[36m(main_task pid=2937563)[0m Doc 3(Title: Snooks - Wikipedia) Snooks is a slang term with several meanings, including "beautiful" or "good-looking" or "hypersexual," often described by a person or object, often to describe a woman's breasts, but also used to describe a man or woman's entire body. The term also refers to Asian born but New Zealand-raised tennis player Luada Snook - Luada Snook is a pet name or nickname, often used in a familiar or friendly manner. The word "snooks" is an alternative spelling of the word "snook," a fish found in the Indian and Pacific Oceans, most commonly in the genus Lutjanus. The word "snooker" comes from a French word, s'baok, meaning "to snooker", a variant of snooker is a (distant) cousin to the term and originated from playing the game of billiards. The word "snook" originated as a term for a penis, possibly originating from the shape of the penis being likened to the hind end of the fish. The term was adopted by Edward Twistleton, a former member of the Freemason lodge.
